              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi nyithindho pa Isakar, dhanum’utuk migi, ku ba wat migi ku ba wat migi, ku ba udi pa weggi ku ba udi pa weggi, calku wel mi nying’, m’ugambre kum ju ma rundi migi pier ario ku ma sagu, dhanu ceke ma copo cidho woko i lwiny; ",
