          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento jukwanu Julawi i kindgi ngo tok suru pa weggi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova yero ni Musa, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suru pa Lawi kende e ma ibikwanu ngo, kadok welgi de ibigamu ngo i kind nyithindho mir Israel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento iketh Julawi wi hema mi lembatuca, man wi jamnine ceke, man wi gin ceke ma jamnine: gibiyeyo hema, ku jamnine ceke; man gibitimo tim i kume, e gibigonjo i ng’et hema gbur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma hema biwotho Julawi bituge piny; man kinde ma jubiguro hemane, Julawi biting’e malu; man jawirok m’ucoro ceng’ni jubinege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E nyithindho mir Israel gibiguro hema migi, ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman ba gonjo pare gire, man ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman bang’ abera pare gire, calkud udul migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Julawi bigonjo i ng’et hema mi lembatuca gbur, kara kwinyo kud ubed wi udul mi nyithindho mir Israel: man Julawi bigwoko kur mi hema mi lembatuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E nyithindho mir Israel gitimo kumeca; calku gin ceke ma Yehova ng’olo ni Musa, gitimo kumeca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
